---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Bane Sullivan"
  description="Co-creator of PyVista and co-founder and CEO of CoDimensional, building software for 3D and physical world data."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="hero">
    <img src="/profile.jpeg" alt="Bane Sullivan" width="96" height="96" />
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>Bane Sullivan</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Co-creator of PyVista. Co-founder and CEO of CoDimensional.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Links -->
  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="https://github.com/banesullivan">GitHub</a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bane-sullivan">LinkedIn</a>
    <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=jslLe0cAAAAJ">Google Scholar</a>
    <a href="https://codimensional.com/news/">Blog</a>
    <a href="mailto:bane@codimensional.com">Email</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- About -->
  <section class="section intro">
    <p>
      I build software that makes complex spatial data intuitive and
      accessible. My open-source work is downloaded more than a million times per month and helps
      researchers, engineers, and their agents work with physical world data.
    </p>
    <p>
      My background in geophysics (applied earth sciences) led me to the intersection of 3D visualization,
      geospatial data, and reproducible workflows, and from there to building software platforms
      full-time. I've shipped products at research-driven startups and enterprise R&D
      organizations.
    </p>
    <p>
      I believe that scientific and engineering findings should be reproducible, not only by other
      practitioners but also by the stakeholders of the problem at hand. That matters more now
      that agents are starting to lead engineering workflows.
    </p>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <!-- Experience -->
  <section class="section">
    <h2>Experience</h2>

    <div class="experience-item">
      <h3>
        CoDimensional PBC <span class="role">Co-Founder & CEO</span>
        <a class="visit" href="https://codimensional.com">
          codimensional.com
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11 L11 5 M6 5 H11 V10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </h3>
      <div class="dates">2026 &ndash; Present</div>
      <p>
        Building the place where agents work on physical world data, which simulations and
        sensors now produce at a scale the tools built for tables can't analyze.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="experience-item">
      <h3>KoBold Metals <span class="role">Senior Software Engineer</span></h3>
      <div class="dates">2023 &ndash; 2025</div>
      <p>
        Developed and deployed a collaborative analysis and 3D visualization platform
        bridging geologists and data scientists. Pushed adoption of cloud-native geospatial
        standards (STAC) and streamlined access to computational tools across the organization.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="experience-item">
      <h3>Kitware, Inc. <span class="role">Senior R&D Engineer</span></h3>
      <div class="dates">2020 &ndash; 2023</div>
      <p>
        Lead developer for Pan3D (3D visualization for PanGeo) and ResonantGeoData
        (geospatial data management). Built enterprise-scale systems and helped
        procure $1.8M+ in commercial contracts and government grants.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="experience-item">
      <h3>Colorado School of Mines <span class="role">Graduate Researcher</span></h3>
      <div class="dates">2018 &ndash; 2020</div>
      <p>
        Explored the intersection of 3D visualization, geoscience, and reproducible workflows.
        Created PyVista and other open-source tools to make 3D scientific computing accessible.
        Awarded the Mendenhall Prize for outstanding M.Sc. student in Geophysics.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <!-- Projects -->
  <section class="section">
    <h2>Open Source</h2>

    <div class="project-item">
      <h3><a href="https://pyvista.org">PyVista</a></h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Co-creator & lead maintainer &middot; NumFOCUS affiliated &middot; 1M+ monthly downloads</p>
      <p>
        3D visualization and mesh analysis through a streamlined interface for VTK.
        Used by thousands of open-source projects and packages across
        engineering, geophysics, and scientific computing. It is the foundation my
        work at CoDimensional grew from.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project-item">
      <h3><a href="https://github.com/banesullivan/localtileserver">localtileserver</a></h3>
      <p class="project-meta">Creator &middot; 50k+ monthly downloads &middot; used in 600+ projects</p>
      <p>
        Dynamic tile serving for interactive visualization of large geospatial rasters
        directly in Jupyter notebooks.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <hr />

  <!-- Education -->
  <section class="section">
    <h2>Education</h2>

    <div class="education-item">
      <h3>M.Sc. Hydrology</h3>
      <p class="details">Colorado School of Mines &middot; Hydrological Science & Engineering</p>
    </div>

    <div class="education-item">
      <h3>B.Sc. Geophysics</h3>
      <p class="details">Colorado School of Mines &middot; Minor in Computer Science</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <!-- Closing -->
  <section class="section intro">
    <p>
      Beyond all the coding and science, I'm a trail runner, mountain biker, and general
      human-powered adventure enthusiast. Feel free to <a href="mailto:bane@codimensional.com">reach out</a>.
      I'm always happy to talk about 3D data that has outgrown its tools, open-source software, or epic outdoor activities.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
